{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "40f4384d-ac65-4099-b2cf-fae221c2557c",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4030",
            "content": {
                "en": "They appear to be the final few pages of the diary.",
                "zh": "看起来是日记的最后几页。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -968.7999877929688,
            "positionY": 460.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "68f2739a-55e3-4f63-87eb-34203ad19b96",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4063",
            "content": {
                "en": "In the end, it still fell to me.",
                "zh": "“事情终究还是落到了我身上。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -76.80000305175781,
            "positionY": 366.3999938964844,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "371026d9-0aed-4977-af17-b585e4952983",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4064",
            "content": {
                "en": "They said I’m now capable of presiding over the ritual on my own.",
                "zh": "他们说，我已经可以独自主持仪式了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 265.6000061035156,
            "positionY": 366.3999938964844,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a32d1560-3ee3-4cfc-8499-e45b6e6f679e",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4065",
            "content": {
                "en": "They said I would become the youngest priestess in the Shen family.",
                "zh": "他们说，我会成为沈家最年轻的祭司。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 611.2000122070313,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b0786f2b-0c33-4bac-ae76-6ae98774a2be",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4066",
            "content": {
                "en": "Now I understand.",
                "zh": "现在的我明白了，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 988.7999877929688,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fc5fa6d0-9cae-486c-beed-4d2a32195cec",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4067",
            "content": {
                "en": "People have to learn to accept what they are meant to bear.",
                "zh": "人总要学会接受自己该承担的东西。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1345.5999755859375,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "dee218bc-6da5-4b31-a7eb-f73cd575ffd2",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4068",
            "content": {
                "en": "Those rules, those rituals, those things passed down from one generation to the next,",
                "zh": "那些规矩、那些仪式、那些一代代传下来的东西，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1711.199951171875,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f1edca77-ad51-4d37-86cf-5a0e6b0ce3bf",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4069",
            "content": {
                "en": "since they were always meant to be inherited by me,",
                "zh": "既然注定要由我继承，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2067.199951171875,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "261b5882-e6e2-4cdb-b380-b09ed803a98a",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4070",
            "content": {
                "en": "then I shouldn’t run from them any longer.",
                "zh": "那我就不该再逃了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2427.199951171875,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "10d7ce06-f940-4a51-b515-cc146b127b97",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4071",
            "content": {
                "en": "Not everyone is worthy of understanding what this means,",
                "zh": "不是所有人都配理解这份意义，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2780.0,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cd8862b3-1c98-4242-8d3f-b3208fcbc667",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4072",
            "content": {
                "en": "and not everyone has the right to come near it.",
                "zh": "也不是所有人都有资格靠近它。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3152.0,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "694b8e13-3751-4ea1-a6cf-d5e99c6e76c1",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4073",
            "content": {
                "en": "...From now on,",
                "zh": "……从今以后，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3511.199951171875,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f25b7d87-98ac-4912-be1f-8a6b8b272fdb",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4074",
            "content": {
                "en": "I won’t doubt anymore.",
                "zh": "我不会再怀疑了。”",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3861.599853515625,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "493af475-dbf9-4562-b4b7-460d433d3599",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "032e23aa-1c44-460f-8151-ed6d83b5348c",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4075",
            "content": {
                "en": "How did Noema get tangled up in something like this...?",
                "zh": "梦之她，怎么会和这些事扯上关系……",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4235.2001953125,
            "positionY": 376.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "81f2f2c1-fe18-441d-b069-eb39f5d0d3aa",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4076",
            "content": {
                "en": "Thinking back on everything that happened on the plane last night, none of it feels right.",
                "zh": "昨晚飞机上发生的一切，现在想起来，实在太不对劲了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4584.80029296875,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f9a0b4db-f21f-44cc-b20d-314016a4e773",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4077",
            "content": {
                "en": "No. I can’t jump to conclusions based on just these few pages.",
                "zh": "不对，我不能只凭这几张纸就下结论。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4953.60009765625,
            "positionY": 360.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1daf9c29-20c1-47e5-8d3b-7abc8bb67a42",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4078",
            "content": {
                "en": "I need to ask her about all of this face to face.",
                "zh": "这些事，我一定要当面问清楚。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5327.2001953125,
            "positionY": 376.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "02109ad0-a2d2-4429-a792-ee71b9597571",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4085",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema’s Diary - After. Read it?",
                "zh": "沈梦之的日记 后，要阅读吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -580.7999877929688,
            "positionY": 460.0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
